        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(anthropic): reject invalid Claude session cursors",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where Claude session catalog callers could provide an invalid pagination cursor and have the local catalog silently fall back to the first list page or latest transcript page.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe Anthropic plugin now treats local Claude catalog cursors as optional only when the field is absent. When a list, transcript, or gateway catalog cursor is present but invalid, the plugin raises the existing catalog-parameter error at the owner boundary without trimming or otherwise normalizing the opaque cursor token.\n\n## User Impact\n\nOperators browsing Claude session catalog pages now get a clear invalid-cursor error for malformed pagination state instead of seeing misleading reset pagination results.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Claim proved: local Claude session list, transcript read, and gateway local-host cursor query reject null, blank, overlong, and whitespace-wrapped opaque cursors while omitted cursor still returns the first/latest page.\n- Current-head focused test at `ca5b725099ab1186c6aa29901fabb3edad85ea4e`: `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/anthropic/session-catalog.test.ts -- --testNamePattern \"merges CLI indexes|reads newest transcript\"` passed with 1 file, 2 tests passed, 5 skipped.\n- Current-head node-host command proof at `ca5b725099ab1186c6aa29901fabb3edad85ea4e`: `node --import tsx --input-type=module -` invoked the real `createClaudeSessionNodeHostCommands()` handlers for `anthropic.claude.sessions.list.v1` and `anthropic.claude.sessions.read.v1` against a temporary Claude project.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"head\": \"ca5b725099ab1186c6aa29901fabb3edad85ea4e\",\n  \"commands\": [\n    \"anthropic.claude.sessions.list.v1\",\n    \"anthropic.claude.sessions.read.v1\"\n  ],\n  \"omittedCursor\": {\n    \"listSessionCount\": 1,\n    \"listNextCursorPresent\": true,\n    \"readItemCount\": 1,\n    \"readNextCursorPresent\": true\n  },\n  \"rejected\": {\n    \"listWrappedValid\": \"catalog cursor is invalid\",\n    \"listNull\": \"catalog cursor is invalid\",\n    \"listBlank\": \"catalog cursor is invalid\",\n    \"listOverlong\": \"catalog cursor is invalid\",\n    \"readWrappedValid\": \"transcript cursor is invalid\",\n    \"readNull\": \"transcript cursor is invalid\",\n    \"readBlank\": \"transcript cursor is invalid\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- Committed diff hygiene: `git diff --check HEAD~1..HEAD` passed.\n- Targeted format: `node_modules\\.bin\\oxfmt.CMD --check --threads=1 extensions\\anthropic\\session-catalog.ts extensions\\anthropic\\session-catalog.test.ts` passed.",
        "branch": "codex/fix-anthropic-session-cursors",
